<title>LEBANON: Lebanon money market rates - Banks Assn.</title>
<headline>Lebanon money market rates - Banks Assn.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lebanese Banks Association issued the following money market details on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Market in Lebanese pounds:</p>
<p>						   Feb 97   Mar 97   Apr 97</p>
<p>	Average rate on Deposits (%)     13.31    12.87     12.60</p>
<p>	Estimated interest spread	   3.81    3.91	 3.99</p>
<p>Market in Foreign Exchange:</p>
<p>	Average rate on Deposits (%)	5.55     5.48	5.60</p>
<p>	Estimated interest spread	   3.44     3.56	3.53</p>
<p>NOTE: Estimated interest spread does not take into account</p>
<p>operating expenses and cost of capital.</p>
<p>-- Beirut editorial (961 1) 602057  745307  745308</p>
